Issue SAK-40404 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Capture this exception: caused by: org.sakaiproject.tool.api.ToolException: org.apache.catalina.connector.ClientAbortException:

When a client aborts it doesn't seem like a Bug Report should be captured/emailed to the Administrator(s). Perhaps I'm wrong about the action associated with this report? (I have only 49 of these from July 24, 2017 until now - all on 11.4).

