Issue SAK-45711 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LoolFileConverter should check HTTP status code
Area: Kernel

New file conversion code uses LoolFileConverter but doesn't check for an HTTP status code return. For example, if access denied (403) or unavailable (404), the code shouldn't convert that into a new Sakai resource.

