## The task
Issue SAK-47393 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: When adding items to a GB category, category order does not match GB settings.
Area: Assignments, Gradebook, Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

In Gradebook settings, the instructor can control the order of the categories. This seems to control the order the categories are displayed in within the gradebook when items are grouped by category. However, when selecting a category for an item (either in Gradebook, or in Tests & Quizzes or Assignments) the category order is all messed up. It’s not in the order of the settings page. It isn’t in alphabetical order. It’s not in the order the categories were created in. I feel that when selecting the category for an item, that list should be in the same order as the GB settings page.

