## The task
Issue SAK-48573 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Messages: Scheduled messages CC to email address not delivered
Area: Messages Tool

Scheduled messages not delivered to users inbox.

Setting a message to be dispatched in 5 minutes time with the CC to recipients email address does not actually send the message as an email. The internal scheduling works fine.

In sakai v20 the email is sent but it is dispatched immediately instead of waiting for the scheduled time. 

In v21 & v22 there’s no scheduling option!

