Title: Gradebook Category gets lost if T&Q title contains high Unicode Chars
Area: Gradebook, Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

If a assessment contains high Unicode (>,<,&,”) chars the assigned category is not displayed. There is no difference if the category has high Unicode chars or not. Steps to reproduce:

# Have “Gradebook” and “T&Q” in your Site. In “Gradebook” have “Category” activated
# Create a Category “Category“ 
# Create a new assessment that has a high Unicode in the titel “Test < Test“ 
# Choose “Grades sent to Gradebook…“ and choose  “Category“ in “Select a category (optional)”
# Save and Publish
# Choose “Settings“ of the published assessment
# Under “Grading and Feedback“ you can see that the selected category is not displayed. Instead it is “Uncategorized“

