## The task
Issue SAK-50599 (Improvement, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Tests with SEB should return to T&Q parent page instead of "Begin Assessment" page
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

When one test is configured with Safe Exam Browser, the “Begin assessment” page has a button “Launch Safe Exam Browser”.

This button begins the test in a new page of SEB lockdown browser. When the exam is submitted, SEB closes and users return to the previous “Begin assessment” page.

The “Launch Safe Exam Browser” button is still available and it starts SEB again. But if the test has reached its limit of submissions, a warning page is printed and there’s no way of exiting SEB unless the button for exiting SEB has been previously enabled in test settings.

This is a minor annoyance as computer could be turned off, but a simple solution would be that SEB would return to T&Q parent page, so if test doesn’t have any other submission available it is not viewable.

