Issue SAK-50853 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Blocker)
Title: Gradebook: Message students in a group sends the email to the entire site
Area: Gradebook

When the instructor selects to message students from the Gradebook, there are 2 drop-downs:

* Who to message:
** Ungraded students
** Graded students (with the option for min/max grades)
** All students
