## The task
Issue SAK-51044 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Gradebook: Category titles with single quotes trigger problems
Area: Gradebook

To track which columns an instructor has hidden in the Grades view of Gradebook, the ids of gradebook items are used. For categories, titles are used. If single quotes are used in a category title (e.g., “Kirchhoff’s Laws”, a real-life case) this poses problems downstream:

# Sakai 25, 23, & 22: jQuery syntax errors on the console
# Sakai 23 & 22: The ‘All Sections/Groups’ dropdown ceases to filter student rows based on the group or section selected.

More details are in the test plan and the attached screencast, BugDemo-GBCategories-SingleQuotes-20250220.mp4.

