Title: Tests & Quizzes: Question metadata varied order results in duplicates in statistics
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

If you create a test using the metadata objectives and/or keywords, if they are in different orders between the questions, they are not recognized as the same item in the Statistics view. 

If question 1 has keywords listed as: rose, flowers
and question 2 has keywords listed as: flowers, rose

the keywords listed in Statistics are:

flowers
rose
flowers
rose

Objectives do the same thing. I would think that the order of these tags shouldn’t matter, and they should be recognized as the same tags.

