Issue SAK-51375 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: Resources: Cannot edit folder permissions as instructor
Area: Resources

This bug is coupled with the current fix for [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50984|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50984|smart-link] (as of this writing). When an instructor attempts to select ‘Edit Folder Permissions’ for a folder in Resources other than the root folder, a permissions error displays. Refer to the attached screenshot, EditFolderPermissionsError-20250414.png.

Also, the only errors reported for this case are via the console. Given the nature of this bug, which seems to be a server side problem, errors and/or exception stack traces should be logged to catalina.out to aid Sakai administrators to troubleshoot issues.

Currently this bug only affects 26.x and 25.x because of the presence of a fix for [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50984|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50984|smart-link]. If that fix is merged to 23.x, for example, then this bug will also affect 23.x. Etc.

