## The task
Issue SAK-51502 (Feature Request, Verified, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Sort tags in alphabetical order
Area: Conversations

When Tags are added in Conversations, they appear listed in the order added. This is true in both the Manage Tags area and in the dropdown menu for selecting tags to apply to a topic. Since tags are not always added in a specific order, the order may appear arbitrary to the end user, and it may be more difficult to located tags in a long list when they are not in an easily discernable order. Ordering them alphabetically would make the list more predictable and it would be easier to scan and locate individual tags.

