## The task
Issue SAK-51839 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: Assignments: Grade overrides for Anonymous Group assignments reveal student identities in the Legacy grading interface
Area: Assignments

If using anonymous grading for a group submitted assignment the Grade Overrides feature in the Legacy grading interface reveals the student identities. Logically, Grade Overrides are not compatible with Anonymous grading and should probably not be an option in either Legacy or New Grading interfaces. (fyi: in the New Grading interface Grade Overrides show the anonymized id not the student id)

