## The task
Issue SAK-52030 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: "lessonbuilder.folder.hidden" should create base folder "hidden with accessible contents" instead of "hidden"
Area: Content, Lessons

After [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50993|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50993|smart-link] links to Resources files from Lessons respect access control, changing the old behavior.

The property “lessonbuilder.basefolder” configures Lessons to put the loaded files in a specific folder of Resources. And the property “lessonbuilder.folder.hidden”, if true, makes this folder to be hidden.

With the last change, it has no sense to have this folder hidden. Folder should now be created “hidden with accessible contents” so it can keep working with Lessons.

