Issue SAK-52205 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Blocker)
Title: Polls: min/max options without validation
Area: Polls

Testing [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52039|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52039|smart-link] 

The main page when creating a poll has changed, with the min and max limits being available to be set before any answer options are added.

I set the min to 1 and max to 6 when I created the new poll. Then I added 2 answer options. On the main polls page for this poll, I clicked save and it saved the poll with the max limit being higher than the number of options available.

I can also set the min to a higher number than the answer options for the poll and it saves.

On 25x, the min and max options are not available until after answer options are added, and there is validation to make sure the user does not choose a max option that is higher than the number of answer options in the poll.

