## The task
Issue SAK-52372 (Feature Request, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Improve UI of "Download All" Assignments Screen
Area: Assignments

The current UI of the Download All screen in Assignments could use some improvement. The T&L/UX group would like to propose the following changes:

* Currently, selecting “All” at the top selects/deselects all of the options as well as the “Include students who have not yet submitted.” However, the options above have to do with data, and the bottom check box has to do with users. They are not really the same thing. We think they should be separated both visually and functionally into distinct groupings. 
* We think that the most common selections should be checked by default, instead of forcing users to check the box to include items. Individual options may be deselected, but if the most common ones are already checked by default it will save time and clicks. The “Select all” and “All students” options should be selected by default.
* It would be nice to also have the option to filter the download file by group/section as well as submission status.

See the proposed mockup below with the default options already selected:

!download-all-proposed-changes.png|width=607,alt="download-all-proposed-changes.png"!

