Issue SAK-52467 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Discussions: Rubric icon links to original site after Discussions-only import
Area: Forums Tool, Rubrics

If a discussion topic or forum with a linked rubric is imported to another site without including the gradebook tool, I would expect the rubric association to be dropped. Instead, the rubric icon appears next to the topic name in the destination site. Any user who is also a member of the original site can click on the icon and view the rubric. A user who is not a member of the original site gets the empty Preview Rubric modal when they click the icon. If the instructor edits the settings for the topic or forum, the grading is not set and saving the settings makes the rubric icon disappear. 

It’s linking to the rubric in the original site - editing the rubric in the original site after the import changes the rubric that appears in the destination site.  

This only occurs when Discussions is imported without Gradebook. If Discussions & Gradebook are imported to a destination site without rubrics, the rubric icon is not present.

