Title: Forums Tool: Log noise due to permission check in GradingServiceImpl.getAssignments
Area: Forums Tool

steps to reproduce:

* Use a site with the Discussion/Forums tool.
* Use a student (or any user) without the permissions: gradebook.editAssignments, gradebook.gradeAll, gradebook.gradeSection.
