Issue SAK-52534 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Optimize Gradebook external assignment lookups for Samigo removals
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

A slow MySQL query was observed against GB_GRADABLE_OBJECT_T filtering only by OBJECT_TYPE_ID and EXTERNAL_ID. For Samigo, the external id is the published assessment id, and the removal path already receives a gradebook UID but was passing null to {{removeExternalAssignment}}, forcing a global external-id lookup across all gradebooks.

This change scopes Samigo external assessment removal to the known gradebook UID

