## The task
Issue SAK-52604 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Announcements tool hides future announcements from instructors who can edit them
Area: Announcements

The Announcements tool currently retrieves messages through the normal view-filtered channel path. Since SAK-49544, that path applies release/retract visibility via PrivacyFilter, so an instructor who did not create a future-dated announcement  may not see it in the Announcements tool even if they have permission to edit all announcements in the site. This is correct for Dashboard/synoptic/API view surfaces, but incorrect for the Announcements management tool.

