## The task
Issue SAK-52654 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Site Info: Tool Order action Pop-up text inaccurate
Area: Site Info

In Site Info: Tool Order tab the pop up tips for the Visibility and Lock actions wording only reflects the state for making the tool invisible or locked locking. If the tool is already invisible or locked the text should invert and indicate click to make visible or click to unlock. Note, the icon html title which is also shown after hovering over the action icon correctly reflects the tool’s state and what clicking it will do. The pop up should do the same. 

See attached images

