## The task
Issue SAK-52749 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: GradebookNG CSV export uses hardcoded ISO-8859-1 instead of UTF-8
Area: Gradebook

_When exporting grades to CSV in GradebookNG, the ExportPanel uses hardcoded ISO-8859-1. This breaks characters in non-Latin languages (like Turkish ğ, ş, ı, İ) turning them into question marks. Changing this to UTF-8 and appending a BOM fixes the issue so Excel opens the file correctly._

