If Resources contains folders or files that are set to This folder and its contents are *publicly viewable* or This folder and its contents are *viewable by all logged in users*, they are reset to be Only *members of this site* can see this folder and its contents on import. 

I would expect that these settings would remain. Unlike the group visibility, they do not depend on groups that may not exist in the new site. 

