## The task
Issue SAK-52812 (Improvement, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: On Import - Replace, set existing pages to removed/inactive but still available in the index
Area: Lessons

When an instructor chooses Import - Replace Content, some existing content is soft-deleted and can be restored if needed. Resources, Assignments, Tests & Quizzes all can be restored from Trash after they are replaced. Lessons pages are not - the Index of Pages contains only the active imported pages. I would like to see the replaced Lessons pages be soft-deleted and available in the Index of Pages as inactive. 

Inactive / deleted Lessons pages from the source site do not import, so after import the only ones present would be the current active pages and the replaced pages.

