Issue SAK-52825 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: Editing Width/Height in Lessons "Embed Content" dialog erases the item's stored MIME type
Area: Lessons

In lessons tool, when a  item of type ‘Multimedia' is added via  _Embed Content on the Page → URL_
and edited via the 'Edit Multimedia Dialog’ the mimetype gets added  on java side as:

*_ShowPageProducer.createEditMultimediaDialog()_*

{noformat}UIInput.make(form, "mimetype", "#{simplePageBean.mimetype}");{noformat}

but there is no corresponding html element in the template Showpage.html

[https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-44158|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-44158|smart-link] did remove the already commented out section.

So after saving the mimetype is not submitted in the form and override the existing type. 
*_SimplePageBean.editMultimedia()_*

{noformat}i.setHtml(mimetype);{noformat}


As a result the item is now displayed as Object.





{noformat}{noformat}

