## What they wrote in the discussion
- GPT 5.6 Sol Extra High: “SAK-49440 changed the read argument so false marks a message as read and true marks it as unread. The unread counter still treated those values the other way around.

As a result, reading a message did not lower the count, and marking it unread did not raise the count. This change fixes the unread count on Overview and Dashboard.”

