## The task
Issue SAK-52905 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: External Tools > Deployment Table sort issues
Area: LTI

With some LTI tools on the server, click on External Tools > Deployment for a tool, (which initially is 0 unless the tool has already been added to a site). If there are no sites listed, click on Deploy Tool to Sites and add some sites. Also add a Deployment group ID to some sites.

On the main Manual Tool Deployment page the sites are listed in a table. On the initial load, the table is in alphabetical order based on the Site ID, clicking on Site ID reverses the sort, while clicking again loses any sort order, neither up/down triangle is bold. This is the same issue as in [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52897|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52897|smart-link] 

The same issue is present for the other columns.

