Issue SAK-52920 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Duplicate Site should use Import from Site functionality
Area: Site Info

Duplicate Site currently uses a separate content-copy workflow, so its results can differ from Site Info → Import from Site. Duplication should produce the same result as importing all tools, content, permissions, and available settings into the new site.
Both actions should share the same import implementation so fixes and improvements apply consistently, without maintaining separate copy logic. Preserve the new-site setup, including the chosen title and academic term.

