## The task
Issue SAK-52924 (Task, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Replace the shared Vue tag selector with a Lit web component
Area: Tags

The shared tag selector still depends on Vue, which conflicts with Sakai's web-component direction and leaves a legacy UI dependency to address before expanding global and site-local tag selection under [SAK-52046|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52046].

Completion requires all current consumers to retain their existing tag selection, creation, filtering, saved-value display, and form-submission behavior, with keyboard accessibility preserved and no remaining dependency on the Vue tag selector.

Playwright coverage must verify the affected user flows; global/site collection scope, permission changes, and the Tags JPA migration remain separate work.

