## The task
Issue SAK-52931 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: deleted assignment and topic links still present for instructor after items were deleted
Area: Assignments, Forums Tool, Lessons

Linked Discussion topics and assignments keep an active link in Lessons even when the items are deleted.

[https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52857|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52857|smart-link] fixed the quizzes issue. When a quiz is deleted, there is no longer an active link for the instructor and it displays as deleted.

For Discussion topics, the topic does show as deleted, but the link still seems active for the instructor. If the instructor clicks on the link, a pop-up displays “This forum or topic has been deleted.” and a blank Lessons page displays.

For Assignments, the assignment does show as deleted but if the instructor clicks on it, the link takes the instructor to the deleted assignment.

Links for deleted items should not be active.

!image-20260928-155104.png|width=404,alt="image-20260928-155104.png"!

