## The task
Issue SAK-52642 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Microsoft - Implementing Microsoft Team Archive Job
Area: Microsoft Integration

Microsoft - Implementing Microsoft Team Archive Job

Teams to archive should be added manually on MC_TEAM_ARCHIVE table. The information needed is on the table MC_SITE_SYNCHRONIZATION.

* ID
* SITE_ID
* TEAM_ID
* ARCHIVE_DATE - NULL
* STATUS - 0

Go to Quartz jobs and create the Microsoft Team Archive Job

While the job is running, it will read the rows with status 0 in blocks of 50 and attempt to archive the teams.

If success then the ARCHIVE_DATA is filled and the STATUS 1

if fail then the ARCHIVE_DATA is NULL and the STATUS -1.

