## The task
Issue SAK-52738 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Microsoft - Groups are not created when the Microsoft team has been created from Site Info -> Enable team
Area: Microsoft Integration

h3. Impact

Microsoft groups are not created when a Microsoft team is created from Site Info -> Enable team. This affects users who expect the group to be created as part of the team setup.

h3. Expected behaviour

Microsoft groups should be created when the Microsoft team has been created from Site Info -> Enable team.

h3. Actual behaviour

Microsoft groups are not created when the Microsoft team has been created from Site Info -> Enable team.

