## The task
Issue SAK-51411 (Feature Request, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: T&Q Calculated Questions: Allow formula verification and generate new example solutions
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

The current calculated question creation/editing window in Samigo allows previewing one example of the existing calculation results in order to check for errors and verify them. However, due to the way it is built, the result shown is always the same example. Furthermore, although formula errors are checked, there is no way to see an example result of those formulas. The new development should enable the ability to verify formulas through numerical examples, as well as generate new random values for the variables, producing new examples.



