Issue SAK-52189 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Resources: Error when uploading a file equal to the maximum size
Area: Resources

In Resources, when trying to upload a file larger than the configured maximum size (default 20 MB), the user sees a warning that the maximum size has been exceeded. However, if a file exactly at the maximum size (20 MB) is uploaded, *the user sees no error, but the file is not uploaded*. In other cases, an error appears: "Server responded with 0 code" when trying to upload files at higher maximum sizes (e.g., 200 MB).

