Issue SAK-52275 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Assignments PeerReview: Schedule a retry after detecting an error in reviewer allocation
Area: Assignments

The job responsible for allocating reviewers for peer-review assignments runs when the review period opens. We have detected that, in some cases, the reviewer allocation is not performed. The job should be able to reschedule itself and run again in these situations. Otherwise, the reviewer allocation is not triggered again until instructors manually modify the review date.

In addition, this process currently has very limited logging, which is insufficient to detect malfunctions.

## What this person changed
