Issue SAK-52325 (Feature Request, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Site Info - Joinable Set: Group restrictions
Area: Site Info

Allow instructors to restrict which students can join a specific Self-enrollment group set (Joinable Set) based on their membership in existing groups.

--

* Added a selector during the creation and editing of joinable sets to define "restriction groups".
* Students only see and can join groups within a set if they meet the configured group membership restrictions; otherwise, the groups are hidden.
* A new "Restrictions" column has been added to the group management table to quickly identify restricted groups.
* Groups currently used as a restriction for a joinable set cannot be deleted.

