## The task
Issue SAK-52400 (Feature Request, Resolved, Fixed, priority Minor)
Title: Create polls in batch
Area: Polls

Sometimes, at our university, people need to create many identical polls on the same site and the steps are repetitive.

A nice feature would be the ability to create several polls at once from a CSV/XLS file.

Some fields to include could be the question text, opening and closing dates, access public/site/groups (if group aware polls is developed before), results visibility, minimum and maximum limit of selectable options and, finally, the different poll options.

