## The task
Issue SAK-52431 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: T&Q SEB: Allow using file upload questions when permissions are set to allow uploading
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

In [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50633|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50633|smart-link], the ability to use file upload questions when using SEB was restricted, regardless of the SEB configuration, even though SEB itself does allow this. This restriction was introduced under the assumption that uploading files was not possible when using SEB, but the issue was actually caused by an incorrect configuration in the file that was used. See [The SEB Configuration File for Downloading & Uploading Files doesn't work. · Issue #1123 · SafeExamBrowser/seb-win-refactoring|https://github.com/[user]/seb-win-refactoring/issues/1123] and [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50633|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50633|smart-link].

