## The task
Issue SAK-52725 (Improvement, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Polls: Usability improvements for bulk poll CSV import
Area: Polls

Following the implementation of [[SAK-52400] Create polls in batch - Jira|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52400], T&L/UX group reviewed the feature and recommended:

* The import file should include and expect column headings.
* Users should be able to download a sample CSV file to use as a template.
* The current yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm format is too technical and error-prone for regular users. Date and Time should be split into separate columns/fields within the CSV file so they are easily recognized and handled without database format knowledge.

