Issue SAK-52762 (Bug, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: Prevent moving a top-level parent page to the left margin
Area: Lessons

When using "More Tools" → "Add More Pages" → "Put existing page in the left margin", the dialog states: *"Does not create a new copy of the page. You can use this to restore a page that has been deleted to the left margin."*

Since this feature is intended to move subpages to the left margin or restore deleted pages, it should not allow selecting a top-level Lessons parent page. The UI should prevent this.

Currently, if an in-use top-level parent page is moved to the left margin, a duplicate Lesson is created and the original Lesson loses its content.

