Issue SAK-51493 (Bug, Closed, Won't Fix, priority Critical)
Title: Due Date and Late Submission Deadline are not checked
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

When configuring a test settings, Due date and Late submissions deadline are empty by default in the date fields.

In previous Sakai versions these dates were checked and the settings couldn’t be saved or the test couldn’t be published if they were empty.

But in Sakai 25 and Sakai trunk there are new date fields and they are not checked. The test settings can be saved and the test can be published without checking them.

