- I’ve submitted a PR that addresses the root issue where a PermissionException when accessing an Assignment (external) would cause an NPE and therefore not complete the request to endpoint “{{/sites/{siteId}/grades}}", which lead to all the console errors in the description. The PermissionException is still visible in the logs as the lookup is using gradebook data to then lookup external grade assignments but the user doesn’t have access to the actual Assignment. It will avoid showing those items which access is denied (i.e. PermissionException).

