## The task
Issue SAK-51728 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Blocker)
Title: Date Manager: Shift dates fails - no console or log errors
Area: Date Manager

This may be related to [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-51680|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-51680|smart-link] 

When my initial testing for all available tools in the date manager failed, I created another site with fewer tools: Announcements, Discussions and Assignments. Shifting the dates for all tools by 2 days worked on 23 and 22. However, this fails totally on 25 and 26.

There are no errors in the console or in the server logs. The server logs don’t even register that anything was done in the date manager.

*I repeated the test with only announcements and assignments* and it still did not work.

The Save Changes button remains disabled, while on 23 & 22, a pop-up displays and saving the changes displays a message that the dates were updated.

This also applies to the button “Apply to expanded sections only”

