## The task
Issue SAK-51749 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Blocker)
Title: T&Q: After creating a quiz and associating with an existing GB item, user is not able to send a new quiz to the GB
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

If the instructor creates a GB item, then creates a quiz and selects Grades sent to MANUALLY created gradebook, the next quiz created cannot use the Grades sent to Gradebook option. Even though this is a new quiz with a different name and the instructor wants to select Grades sent to Gradebook, the previous quiz’s linked GB item is still set in settings. You can see this when clicking on Grades sent to MANUALLY.

The drop-down no longer has the “Select a Gradebook Item” option, so the drop-down defaults to the last item used.

