## The task
Issue SAK-52042 (Sub-task, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Remove genericdao from Signup tool
Area: Signup

Migrate Signup tool away from genericdao to standard Hibernate/JPA patterns.

h2. Migration Steps

# Identify all {{Search}} and {{Restriction}} usages
# Create explicit DAO interface with domain-specific methods
# Implement DAO with Hibernate {{SessionFactory}} or JPA {{EntityManager}}
# Replace {{Search}}/{{Restriction}} queries with HQL/JPQL
# Add {{[user]}} annotations on service methods
# Update Spring configuration to use {{TransactionProxyFactoryBean}} or {{[user]}}
# Update tests to mock new DAO methods
# Remove {{genericdao}} dependency from POM

h2. Reference

See {{docs/genericdao-migration.md}} and Polls POC for migration patterns.

