## The task
Issue SAK-52526 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Tests & Quizzes: Keep Gradebook category association on import
Area: Gradebook, Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

On import to another site, any tests that are set to create their own GB item are set as Uncategorized, requiring instructors to set the categories manually - either through the test settings or Gradebook. 

If the test is assigned to a Gradebook category in the original site, it should be in the same category in the destination (assuming it exists), just like Assignments does.

