Title: Site Archive: No pagination, no ability to sort columns and no search
Area: Site Archive (Admin)

The Site Archive > Download Archives page does not have the ability to sort by columns, search, or pagination. On trunk there were a total of 544 archive files today and I had to use the browser search to find my site. 

