Issue SAK-50891 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Date Manager does not include draft label for Discussion topics
Area: Date Manager, Forums Tool

Discussion topics can be dated and saved as drafts. However, when looking at Discussions in the Date Manager, there is no indication that a topic is in draft mode. Announcements can also be saved as a draft, and Date Manager doesn’t show the label either.

Assignments can only have one state, and if an assignment is in draft mode, that is indicated in the Date Manager. I think Discussion topics also need the draft label since the instructor could change the dates to an earlier date and not realize the topics isn’t even published.

