## The task
Issue SAK-52324 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Test & Quizzes: search fails when last name is 2 words
Area: Tests & Quizzes (Samigo)

This may be an edge case, but I have a user called Ramón Núñez Pérez. Ramón is shown as the first name and Núñez Pérez as the last name. While testing [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52283|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52283|smart-link], the following pages are affected in Tests & Quizzes: 

* Submission Status
* Total Scores
* Questions

When searching for either accented or unaccented Ramón or Núñez, results are found on those pages. If searching for either accented or unaccented Pérez, no results are returned.

The other pages in Tests & Quizzes are working fine when using accented/unaccented Pérez.

