## The task
Issue SAK-50559 (Improvement, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Course Dashboard: Add option for instructor to set color or image for course card
Area: WC User Dashboard

The new course cards uses the course image (set in Course Dashboard Layout #2) as the background of the card, otherwise it is the default grey. This means that if a course doesn’t use the course Dashboard, or uses one of the alternate layouts, the card will only be grey. 

I’d like to see an option for the instructor to set the card to an image or solid color from the User Dashboard. This could be a small icon on the card for that class. It could also be an additional option in the Site Info → Edit Site Information page. 

When setting the card image, instructors should have the option to select a solid color, upload an image, or revert to the default (course image or grey)

