Title: Ensure all webcomponents tests pass and run the tests in the maven build
Area: Web Components

Ensure all webcomponents tests pass and run the tests in the maven build. Lerna allows us to run tests on all changes since a particular git commit. If we use HEAD~1 that will mean that our github builds will run webcomponents unit tests on anything in the latest commit.

