## The task
Issue SAK-51299 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Conversations search: if Search is not on the navigation or search.onlyIndexSearchToolSites is not false, don't show the Search icon for Conversations
Area: Conversations

In order for Search to work, it is dependent on 2 items:

* search.enabled=true
* search.onlyIndexSearchToolSites

In Conversations, if search.enabled=true, then the little search icon shows up on the page. 

# If search.onlyIndexSearchToolSites = true AND
# the site does not have Search on the navigation

the user will not be able to retrieve any results from a Conversations search.

!image-20250403-161724.png|width=838,height=77,alt="image-20250403-161724.png"!

If search.enabled=true, but If search.onlyIndexSearchToolSites = true and Search is not on the navigation, the icon should not display.

