Issue SAK-51407 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: Conversations Grading: if instructor opens the grading screen for a student already graded, there is no way to close the pop-up if no changes are made
Area: Conversations

If the instructor is looking through graded topics and clicks on the Grade dropdown for a student that has already been graded, there is no way to close the pop-up if no changes are being made except to refresh the page. Even clicking off the pop-up does not close it.

An instructor may want to review a grade and any comments without making changes. Or, if a TA graded, the instructor may want to review any comments left by the TA. If everything looks good, there needs to be a way to close the pop-up.

