## The task
Issue SAK-51444 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Grades widget: Number of ungraded for group items
Area: WC Grades Widget

The grades widget shows the instructor the number of ungraded items.

However, the # of ungraded is not accurate when dealing with assignments or tests that are released to a group. 

I would expect the number of ungraded would be only those students that could receive a grade for that item. 

Teaching & Learning Question: If a class has 20 students, 5 groups of 4, and a group submission assignment released to all 5 groups, should the number of ungraded be 20 (students) or 5 (groups/submissions)?

