Issue SAK-52630 (Improvement, Resolved, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Add support for the role query parameter in Sakai's LTI implementation
Area: LTI

LTI1.3’s Names and Role Provisioning Service specifies that a platform can accept a query parameter called “role” and filter the returned members accordingly. Currently, Sakai’s implementation does not honour that - this ticket will sort that out.

