## The task
Issue SAK-50752 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Announcements support in CC+Archive archive / merge
Area: Announcements

Announcements are exported but not imported in a CC+Archive.   This Jira is to fix the import process, making sure not to double import things if an import is done more than once.  If you export a site with announcements, it does seem to export properly to {{announcement.xml}} but import seems not to process the file.

*Developer Note:* The import for Announcements inherits its the merge() code from {{BaseMessageService()}}.  This is  re-used both by {{BaseMailArchiveService()}} and {{BaseAnnouncementService()}} and in the Message code itself.  The pattern reuses code reasonably well. but confuses dependency injection between the abstract and concrete classes.

*Developer Note:* I ran across the problem with Lessons RTE import described in  [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50953|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50953|smart-link] and fixed it.

