## The task
Issue SAK-50802 (Bug, Closed, Won't Fix, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: Don't import if there are no items in a lesson
Area: Lessons

Because the CC+Archive feature is in Lessons, to get a CC+Archive export you mist add the Lessons tool even if you don’t want to use lessons and optionally keep it empty and hidden from students.

These exports end up of a lessons export which is devoid of items.

If there is nothing in Lessons placement and you do a CC+Archive Export then import several times into another site, multiple empty Lessons tools are placed on the navigation.

