## The task
Issue SAK-50943 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Web Content cc+ export not keeping the "open in new window" option
Area: Lessons, Web Content

I’m not certain if it’s even possible to pass the “Open in new window” setting for Web Content, but in case it is, it would be nice if it could be passed. Even a Site Info > Import from Site does not bring over that setting.

The new window setting has to be added after the Web Content URL has been added in Site Info. 

From Site Info > Manage Tools:

!image-20250201-220937.png|width=566,height=283,alt="image-20250201-220937.png"!

It would be nice if the checkbox could just be added there, but since it’s not, after adding the Web Content, and finishing with Manage Tools, click on the Web Content link in the navigation.

This will give an error if you added a “https” URL and now you need to edit and check the checkbox to open in a new window.

!image-20250201-220925.png|width=403,height=184,alt="image-20250201-220925.png"!

Exporting the cc+ file from Lessons and importing into another site (using the cc+ option) requires the Web Content URL to be edited because the checkbox setting did not pass in the export.

