## The task
Issue SAK-50978 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: Lessons cc+ import does not import content unless the file is imported twice
Area: Lessons

Tested [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-47782|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-47782|smart-link] and everything worked fine except Lessons. Lessons does not import content unless the file is imported twice. The first time, the import just adds a new blank Lessons page. The second import of the same file then imports the content.

I repeated the test multiple times to make sure, and it fails every time on the first import.

*Developer note:* I made it work on the first import and added duplicate removal on later imports.  See the test plan.

