## The task
Issue SAK-51065 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LTI+Assignments: Include LTI Assignment GB Columns in AGS Service Requests
Area: LTI

When using [https://www.imsglobal.org/spec/lti-ags/v2p0|https://www.imsglobal.org/spec/lti-ags/v2p0|smart-link] with Sakai, tools are only shown grade book columns that belong to them.  The simplest way for an LTI tool to own a grade book column is for the tool to create that grade book column with AGS.   There is another important use case recently identified when working with TJ from Microsoft.  When an LTI tool is launched from the Assignments tool, it should also be able to find the grade book column associated with the tool and match each tool launch with its column using the {{resourceLinkId}}value in the AGS return data.  This way there can be several assignments that launch to the same tool and the tool can figure out which assignment the launch came from and which column will get the grades returned to it.

