Issue SAK-51090 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Critical)
Title: Announcements - cc+ import adding draft announcements for assignments
Area: Announcements, Assignments, Lessons

Announcements should not be imported for assignments.

When doing a cc+ import for assignments, the announcements are now also there (drafts). I believe this should work like the Calendar ( [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50886|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-50886|smart-link] ) where nothing is imported for due dates, but the due date is added once the item is posted. For Announcements, I believe they should not be imported if they are regarding an open date. The announcement should be added when the instructor actually posts the imported assignment or other tool.

Modifying the dates on an assignment but nothing else, posting the assignment, then publishes the announcement. Importing the cc+ file again does not duplicate assignments, but does duplicate the announcements.  [user] if you need a separate Jira for this, let me know, though I think if the announcements do not import at all for open dates, that will not be an issue any longer.

I also think this is a new issue because when I tested before, I had a note that announcements do not import for open dates: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ArTPUbPHBvE4JTdAIXcdA--UU52FxJNLGdmeygaJLAY/edit?gid=1909475765#gid=1909475765|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ArTPUbPHBvE4JTdAIXcdA--UU52FxJNLGdmeygaJLAY/edit?gid=1909475765#gid=1909475765|smart-link] 

