## The task
Issue SAK-52099 (Bug, Verified, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LTI: Frame height is ignored
Area: LTI

This affects both LTI 1.1 and 1.3. On 26 and 25, when installing a tool, there is no option to allow the frame height to be changed, it is just available automatically. On 23, the option is still there when installing a tool and needs to be set to Allow the frame height to be changed.

I set the Breakout tool to be available in Lessons and also on the navigation, and checked the option to Allow popup to be changed so to be sure it can be loaded in an iframe.

No matter what height the instructor sets for the frame height, it always remains at 500.

