## The task
Issue SAK-52345 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LTI Remove the pre-LTI 1.1 Basic Outcomes
Area: LTI

Back before LTI 1.1 - there was BasicLTI that used a form post with no XML to set grades using messages like:

{noformat}POST http://localhost:8080/imsblis/service/

lti_message_type=basic-lis-updateresult
result_resultscore_textstring=0.10
result_resultdata_text=Nice work!
sourcedid=7d65a1b397{noformat}

This was kept for a while as LTI 1.1 became widely used but was deprecated over 10 years ago.   It is time to remove it.  This removes a way to set grades that is simply no longer used and an unnecessary widening of our security front.  

I have the _old_ documentation attached for reference.  The “Basic Outcomes API (Deprecated after LTI 1.1)” is the bit being removed.

