## The task
Issue SAK-52374 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: Lessons: Revert changes that broke Samigo Quiz Resizing introduced in 52276
Area: Lessons

From Sean Horner:

I think the changes made to ShowItem.html, namely stripping out those blocks of iframe related Javascript may have introduced some UX regressions vis-a-vis the embedding of T&Q in Lessons (if not also for Assignments & Discussions). For instance, the iframe height for embedded T&Q is seemingly now fixed to 350px.

Without the {{onload="resizeiframe1()"}}attribute (or something analogous) that calls that resize function, the iframe height remains static when a student is navigating through a quiz or through an assignments whereas the the contents of that iframe often vary widely as the student proceeds through the quiz, assignment, etc.

