## The task
Issue SAK-52392 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LTI / IFrame / Flashing Dark to Light as LTI as iframes switch from internal to external sources
Area: LTI

The fix to [https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52376|https://sakaiproject.atlassian.net/browse/SAK-52376|smart-link] introduced an issue where the iframes are marked as “block dark mode” too early that led to light dark flashes as the iframe progresses through a series of internal / external urls.  The solution is to leave the iframes that will launch internal content that progresses to external content as “propagate dark mode” then at the last minute when the frame is about to be redirected to an external url, add the “force light” class via JavaScript.

