Title: Assignments/LTI Add support for the description field in CI/DL Returns
Area: Assignments

When an instructor selects an external tool via Content Item (LTI 1.1) or Deep Linking (LTI 1.3) while creating/editing an assignment, Sakai already extracts the returned {{title}} and offers to update the assignment title. The CI/DL {{text}} field (description) is stored on the LTI content item but is not applied to the assignment instructions field.

This change extracts {{text}} / content description on return, runs it through FormattedText/AntiSamy, and prompts the instructor to place the cleaned HTML into the assignment instructions (CKEditor).

*Acceptance Criteria:*

* After a CI or DL return that includes {{text}}, the assignment UI offers to use that description for instructions.
* Unsafe HTML in {{text}} is stripped/sanitized via FormattedText (AntiSamy) before it reaches the editor.
* If {{text}} is absent/blank, no description prompt appears; title behavior is unchanged.
* Selecting “Cancel” on the description confirm leaves existing instructions unchanged.

