## The task
Issue SAK-52567 (Bug, Closed, Fixed, priority Major)
Title: LTI TII classic: Assignment submissions not recognized if GB item from GB
Area: Assignments, Gradebook, LTI

Related somewhat to SAK-52505 and for Turnitin classic standard assignments (TII new standard assignments are fine), assignment submission data in the Assignments tool does not update if is configured to use a gradebook item that was created in Gradebook.

Refer to the test plan for a concrete example of this.

Root Issues:

# If a gradebook item created in Gradebook is an LTI line item, check first to see if that gradebook item is associated with an assignment in the Assignments tool. If so, treat the line item like other assignments (as a rule of thumb). (Note, however that such gb items can be associated with multiple assignments. A design decision needs to be made regarding such gb items-- e.g., return the first such assignment or return null or …?)
# Before creating a line item in response to an external tool request, check to see if the content id has been provided in the request’s resourceLinkId parameter. Currently, the code forces the content id to be 0 when it’s recorded in the gradebook item’s database table.

