Title: Calendar: add Playwright E2E coverage (create/edit/delete event, group visibility)
Area: Calendar, E2E

Add a new Playwright Java E2E test class (CalendarTest) covering the Calendar tool, following the pattern already used by AnnouncementTest and the other classes under e2e-tests.

h3. Coverage added

* Create a single event and verify it in the List of Events view
